// markdownlint-cli2 configuration for aligned packages.
//
// Formatting consistency for documentation: every default rule except two.
//
// Off by design:
//   MD013 line-length       - 1588 findings in webware-console alone, and prose
//                             wrapping is not structural consistency
//   MD060 table-column-style - alignment padding, same reasoning
//
// Out of scope, because these trees are not documentation this package authors:
//   .github/**        - agent configuration: copilot-instructions.md is generated
//                       from the preset, skills/ and instructions/ are maintained
//                       by the agent tooling, not by hand as documentation
//   .specify/**       - spec-kit managed templates
//   specs/**          - spec-kit feature specs; they stay in the repo as working
//                       artifacts driving implementation, not as published docs
//   plan/**           - working plans and session handoffs, never published
//
// Measured across the fleet, these trees produced the large majority of findings,
// and none of them were findings an author of published documentation could act on.
//
// Tuned rules, each verified to leave rendered output unchanged:
//   MD024 siblings_only      - repeated heading text under different parents is
//                              normal structure, so only same-parent repeats fail
//   MD033 allowed details, summary - disclosure blocks are authored on purpose
//   MD025 front_matter_title - a YAML `title:` is metadata, not a heading, so a
//                              document carrying both it and its own H1 is one
//                              title, not two
//
// LICENSE.md and COPYRIGHT.md start with prose by convention, so MD041 would
// always fire on them. They are not documentation and are ignored outright.
//
// The required workflow runs this by name as the `markdown` job, and it pins
// markdownlint-cli2 0.24.2. This configuration is validated against that exact
// version; an unpinned run can report a different set of findings.
{
  "config": {
    "default": true,
    "MD013": false,
    "MD024": {
      "siblings_only": true
    },
    "MD025": {
      "front_matter_title": ""
    },
    "MD033": {
      "allowed_elements": ["details", "summary"]
    },
    "MD060": false
  },
  "globs": ["**/*.md"],
  "ignores": [
    "vendor/**",
    "node_modules/**",
    ".github/**",
    ".specify/**",
    "specs/**",
    "plan/**",
    "LICENSE.md",
    "COPYRIGHT.md"
  ]
}
